This is an open source project under Apache 2.0 license. Contributions are welcome!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Ways to contribute:&lt;br&gt;
🐛 Report bugs&lt;br&gt;
💻 Submit features&lt;br&gt;
📝 Improve docs&lt;br&gt;
